<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4135" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλία</span></b>  (A), 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη</span> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱλ], ἡ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>assembly of people</i>, in 
				Dor.
			 states, answering to 
				Att.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκλησία</span>, at Sparta, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁ. συλλέγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.134
				</span></i>
			; at Byz., Decr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.90
			</span></i>; at Corcyra, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				9(1).682
			</span></i>; in Sicily and Magna Graecia, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.952
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Agrigentum</span>), <i><span class="en">
				612
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Rhegium</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tab.Heracl.</u>
				1.118
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.10
			</span></i>; at Epidamnus and Tarentum, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1301b23
			</span></i> (prob. cj. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡλιαία</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> generally,
				<i>meeting, assembly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλίην ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.29
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				79
			</span></i>; of the Persians, <i><span class="en">
				1.125
			</span></i>.</div>
